module github.com/nafsilabs/massa-go/sc

go 1.25.2

// This module provides a pure Go SDK for developing Massa smart contracts
// that compile to WebAssembly. It includes comprehensive functionality for:
//
// - Address operations and validation
// - Persistent storage management
// - Execution context access
// - Contract interactions and calls
// - Balance and coin transfer operations
// - Event generation and structured logging
// - Cryptographic functions (hashing, signatures)
// - Operation-level datastore access
//
// The SDK automatically detects the runtime environment and provides
// mock implementations for testing and development outside of the
// WebAssembly runtime.
